00:01:57.916 --> 00:02:00.000
You know.

00:01:59.016 --> 00:02:08.050
Something kind of girlie for bedtime.

00:02:07.066 --> 00:02:09.383
Yeah.

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:10.383
That looks like a nice little pajama combo right there.

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:13.100
Tank top, baggy pants.

00:02:12.116 --> 00:02:14.916
There you go.

00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:21.416
Pajamas.
